  "category": "arch",
  "status": "DOCUMENTED",
  "intent": "把核心业务放在中心，用\"端口\"定义对外契约、由外层\"适配器\"实现，使技术细节可自由替换。",
  "applicability": {
    "constraints": {
      "core": "pure_business_logic",
      "ports": "interfaces_owned_by_core",
      "adapters": "technology_specific",
      "inbound_outbound": "two_kinds_of_ports"
    },
    "counterexamples": [
      "只有一种技术实现且不打算替换时——端口抽象会变成纯样板",
      "业务逻辑本身没有复杂度时——边界画得再漂亮也无内容可放"
    ],
    "alternatives": [
      "pattern.arch.clean_architecture",
      "pattern.arch.dependency_injection"
    ]
  },
